ifBO / FT-PFN
============

ICICLE's synthetic-prior work builds on ifBO, and icicle_jax/ftpfn contains
inference code for its published FT-PFN reference model. The upstream code is:
https://github.com/automl/ifBO

The following notice is retained from ifBO v0.0.1, commit
87fa05f7c91482b414c1597b4426361fe444b9c5:
https://github.com/automl/ifBO/blob/87fa05f7c91482b414c1597b4426361fe444b9c5/LICENSE

